# makepkg build artefacts
src/
pkg/
*.pkg.tar.zst
*.pkg.tar.zst.sig

# Local payload drops are required for the build and are kept in git only if the
# user chooses to track them:
#   uuyc-wine/local/uuyc-installer.exe
#   uuyc-android/local/com.netease.uuremote.apk

# 工作区/构建临时目录（本仓库作者本机使用，含前缀副本与回归产物）
work/

# makepkg 会把 file:// 源「物化」一份到 $startdir，因此包目录里会反复出现
# 与 support/ 下同名的副本。真正的源在 support/ 下，这些是派生物。
uuyc-wine/uuyc-installer.exe
uuyc-android/com.netease.uuremote.apk
